[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-002
STATUS: Proposed
TITLE: M1a - Canonical IR, Unified Device Descriptor and thin XyceBackend
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement the immutable Canonical IR, fail-closed Unified Device Descriptor registry, typed ResultManifest schema, and thin external-process XyceBackend (GPL-isolated) in Spice.Ir and Spice.Sdk, plus opt-in independent DC/AC/transient physical audits.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M1
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-001
Deliverables: Spice.Ir, Spice.Sdk (ISimulationBackend, XyceBackend), physical-audit checks, and differential RC/RLC/diode/BJT/MOS reference fixtures running on prebuilt Xyce.
Verification: Real circuits execute end-to-end via XyceBackend with typed signals/measurements and passing physical audits; zero GPL/Trilinos linkage in core targets.
<<<
