[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-003
STATUS: Proposed
TITLE: M1b - StarLark-cs DSL frontend and parallel campaign authoring
STATEMENT: >>>
Embed StarLark-cs with SharpUnits dimensional constructors in Spice.Starlark so circuits, hierarchical subcircuits, sweeps, corners, Monte Carlo plans, and assertions compile to Canonical IR and run deterministically with parallel_map on XyceBackend.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M1
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-002
Deliverables: Spice.Starlark host module (@sim/v2), budget enforcement, deterministic parallel_map sweep examples, and IR equivalence tests against C#/F# builders.
Verification: Identical RC, filter, and corner campaigns authored in StarLark-cs and C# produce identical Canonical IR and pass XyceBackend execution.
<<<
