[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-004
STATUS: Proposed
TITLE: M1c - Schematic capture model, ERC and interactive desktop app
STATEMENT: >>>
Build Spice.Schematic (versioned diffable document model, hierarchical subsheets, ERC, Unified Device Descriptor binding, Canonical IR emitter, SPICE/StarLark/SVG export) and the initial Spice.App desktop schematic editor and waveform cross-probing viewer backed by ISimulationBackend.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M1
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-002
Deliverables: Spice.Schematic, Spice.App (schematic editor + live waveform/OP probing), ERC test suite, and round-trip persistence/export tests.
Verification: Circuits drawn in Spice.Schematic compile cleanly to Canonical IR, run on XyceBackend, and support live node/branch cross-probing.
<<<
