- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ARCH-EQ-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-006
STATUS: Proposed
TITLE: M2b - Nonlinear DAE solver, autodiff B-sources and generic OSDI 0.3/0.4 loader
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement dimensioned Newton with voltage limiting and source/Gmin continuation (mandatory final Gmin removal), adaptive BE/Trapezoidal/BDF2 integration with breakpoints, compiled B-source expression VM with dual-number autodiff, and one generic OSDI 0.3/0.4 dynamic loader running OpenVAF-compiled Diode, VBIC/BJT, BSIM3, BSIM4, JFET, and EKV models, plus the native canonical SPICE3f5 parser/elaborator.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M2
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-005
Deliverables: cpp/solver, cpp/devices (B-source VM, switches), cpp/osdi, cpp/parser (SPICE3f5), curated 50-deck Xyce/ngspice differential benchmark suite.
Verification: NativeCppBackend runs transistor/op-amp/filter decks natively in-process faster than ngspice and matches XyceBackend/ngspice with passing physical audits.
<<<
