[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-007
STATUS: Proposed
TITLE: M2c - Full core analog analysis parity, dialects, formats and CLI contract
STATEMENT: >>>
Complete core analog RSpice parity in NativeCppBackend: .NOISE, .PZ, .TF, .SENS, .DCMATCH, .FOUR, .FFT, .MC, --corners, .SP (Touchstone), .STB, TRNOISE, checkpoint/resume, transmission lines (ideal/LTRA/TXL/CPL), saturable core, dialect profiles (ngspice/xyce/best, SPEF, Spectre subset), Arrow/HDF5/RAW/CSV/VCD exports, and the full CLI subcommand/exit-code contract.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M2
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-006
Deliverables: cpp/analysis (complete core analog), cpp/parser (dialect/SPEF/Spectre), export writers, native CLI subcommands and exit-code tests.
